    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλιμπάνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλείπω</span>
			, <i>abandon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				800
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
